  "strategy": "aggro - most reach & evasion",
  "colors": "WU",
  "identity": "A WU Merfolk aggro deck in which combat itself is the engine. Attacking taps creatures, and this list holds 8 'whenever this creature becomes tapped' copies across 6 distinct Merfolk (Encumbered Reejerey, Wanderbrine Preacher, Silvergill Peddler, Tributary Vaulter x2, Pestered Wellguard x2, Champions of the Shoal), so every attack fires free value on top of its damage. Adept Watershaper's 'Other tapped creatures you control have indestructible' removes the usual cost of attacking with small bodies, so the deck can attack with everything every turn regardless of the block. The build was locked under a reach-and-evasion lens: the triggers are spent on flying tokens, unblockability and tapping down blockers rather than on grindy value, so the damage the free taps generate actually connects.",
